## 🏗️ How It Works (Technical Summary)

```
App Launch
    │
    ├── Has cached authorization? ──Yes──┐
    │                                     │
    │                              Internet available?
    │                              ├── Yes → Silent 3s background check
    │                              │         (updates cache if revoked)
    │                              └── No → Skip (use cache as-is)
    │                                     │
    │                               Open app from cache ✅
    │
    └── No cache (first time) ──── Internet available?
                                   ├── Yes → Check Firebase → Cache result
                                   │         ├── active:true → Open app ✅
                                   │         └── not found → Unauthorized ❌
                                   └── No → Show popup: "Connect internet" ❌
```
